proton-autogen (3.2.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Thanks to all users and contributors for their continued support, feedback and bug reports.
  * Expanded UX internationalization with new translations for German, Spanish, Portuguese, Ukrainian, Hindi and Chinese, providing a more accessible and consistent multilingual interface.
  * Improved user-facing UX messages with clearer launch, execution, completion and error status feedback.
  * Improved environment loading performance, reducing startup overhead and making runtime initialization faster.
  * Improved system and environment detection performance, reducing unnecessary checks and speeding up Proton and Wine environment discovery.
  * Optimized game and runtime detection workflows for faster Dashboard loading and improved responsiveness.
  * Improved Proton runtime selection and environment initialization for a smoother launch experience.
  * General UX improvements, performance optimizations and code cleanup.

